      // SW delivered ONE entry (alias + spec) to this freshly created tab.
      // Apply through the ONE shared funnel and post the terminal
      // saved_tabs_drive_apply_response over the page-to-sw bridge —
      // extension-internal plumbing, never the server wire. The receiver
      // ALWAYS answers (bounded by the apply's own long render timeout plus
