      // which is the wrong root and triggers a spurious 'cannot match root
      // UUID' warning. Until a real selection arrives, show the empty-state
      // prompt instead. (A genuine click/focusin sets the flag via
      // showDockedMarkdownPanel and routes through the normal path, not here.)
