  //   kind=ast,
  //   comment=Mounts the deck (GlimpseUI.mount with the api object) once and binds the dock's module element variables (dockedPanelEl = the deck body, dockedListEl = the outline, dockedRenderEl = the document pane, dockedWarnEl / _sliceSyncStatusEl / dockedFreezeNoteEl / dockedStatusFooterEl = the notices and footer) plus the sink that turns legacy widget status writes into Activity entries; the five ribbon refresh closures all become one Reader repaint. Everything visible is built by glimpse-ui.js; nothing here draws.,
