    // ISSUE-2 GUARD: if the selection is moving to a DIFFERENT row, the pane no
    // longer holds good content for the (new) selection. Clear the stamp so a
    // failed render of the NEW row correctly shows the server-unavailable
    // error, even though the previous row's good content is still painted (the
    // single-mode path leaves it in place to avoid a flash). A re-select of the
    // SAME row keeps the stamp (the good view is still valid for it).
