  // forwarded VERBATIM (never re-minted, re-prefixed or normalized — all three
  // group_id flavors round-trip byte-exact). A dom_captured_tree (frozen DOM)
  // or a refusal is reported AS-IS so the widget can LIST the tab as not-
  // exportable with its reason ([ap:2JBVUY] Ask 1 — never silently dropped).
