  //   comment=Saved-Tabs Tier-2 drive receiver (page world, spec [ap:7S217K] §6): non-empty alias -> setEndpointAlias FIRST (re-registers + retitles immediately, P4/G3); admission via savedTabsValidateEntrySpec (the SAME kernel as single-entry import — exact group_id pre-validation); apply through the ONE shared funnel applySliceGroupIntoDock with applySavedTabsEntry's receiver-identical opts (spec untouched by object identity — A1/G4, [ap:HVAWAF]; generation unclaimed — displaySliceInDock claims at paint and force-freezes, G5); a NAME-ONLY frame (spec null + non-empty alias, follow-up 2) stops after the alias-set and answers ok:true with nothing applied; the terminal saved_tabs_drive_apply_response rides the page-to-sw bridge and is ALWAYS sent (bounded by the long render timeout + the socket-death settle, P7); failures loud via the funnel's ONE sink + the Saved-Tabs status line,
