  // highlight), then copy the Markdown SOURCE to the clipboard and show a
  // confirming toast. The visual selection is rendered text; the CLIPBOARD
  // gets the faithful Markdown source (headings '#', code fences, etc.) via
  // copyDockedAsMarkdown — NOT the plain rendered text a manual Ctrl+C would
