  // Markdown STRING(s) (canonical, zoom-proof classification). The browser
  // renders the returned string with composedMarkdownToHtml (unchanged).
  // ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  // Serialize the VISIBLE DOM subtree under projectEl into the nested
  // { root:{id,name,note}, children:[...] } payload the server composer
