    // dormant (after Apply, before the user clicks ⟳ Sync view), the watcher is
    // just a stored sync plan + surfaced search; the user may spend minutes
    // reading the modal, clicking rows, and using arrows/typing in the dock UI.
    // Those modal-navigation gestures must NOT destroy the pending sync plan.
    // Once Sync starts, however, Escape / Ctrl+Space / typing+arrows still mean
    // the user has taken over the live pane, so teardown remains correct.
