  // normalized structured fields (kind/group/root/sort/since/headings -- there
  // is no pre-baked display_label). Scope
  // IDENTITY (group_id/root_uuid) also mirrors into dockedSliceContext (the
  // re-render's scope handle) and the view params mirror into the per-tab
  // render state (dockedModalRenderState via setTabModalState), so every
