  // canonical, zoom-proof Python composer _build_markdown_preview_from_tree,
  // reached via requestMarkdownModalRender -> compose_markdown_modal_view /
  // _snapshot). There is no second in-browser renderer: when the WebSocket /
  // broker is unavailable we surface a clear, actionable message in the dock
  // rather than silently degrading to a divergent local composition. This
  // function (still named renderDockedSelectionLocal so its three call sites
  // in renderDockedMarkdownForSelection stay valid) is the ONE place that
  // paints that error. The former JS composition twin (collectVisibleMarkdown
